# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
/ollupi
/voice-chat
/voice-smoke
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# config files with sensitive information
workspace/*.json
!workspace/*.example.json

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

.DS_Store
.gocache/
.tmp_gocache/

# Local workspace DB and logs (never commit)
workspace/data/*.sqlite
workspace/data/*.sqlite-shm
workspace/data/*.sqlite-wal
workspace/logs/
workspace/AGENTS.md

# Generated desktop build artifacts
desktop/build/bin/
desktop/frontend/package.json.md5

# Local-only design notes (kept out of the repository)
docs/outbound-call-integration.md
